> [!WARNING]
> Paused by [toker](https://github.com/passcod/toker) at [HH:MM]: the prompt cache expired after 11m idle, so the next message re-reads 500,000 tokens into the prompt cache. You can:
> - `/compact`: pay the re-read once for a small prefix.
> - Start a new session: pay nothing, keep none of this context.
> - Reply: carry on and pay the re-read.
